      "Numerical claims beyond exactly approved700 consulting-experience wording; audit success or certification guarantees"
    ],
    "campaign": {
      "revision": "VN-journey-v3",
      "instructions": "One square ad. Same bright white, pale blue, navy and tactile campaign family. Official logo once upper left. Approved category compact but legible; no page number. Main headline very large, bold, readable at332px; body minimum50px equivalent on1254 square. Headline/body/labels/source/CTA only exact approved wording; no additional diagram labels.700+ is very large on R1, qualified by exact consulting-experience body; no maps or geographical claim. Source footer visibly readable. No faces, customer logos, certifications, fake UI, unapproved numbers, false guarantee. Scenes editorial illustrations, not actual facilities. Film components only where case-relevant. Distinct scene per card. Direct address exact Quý Doanh Nghiệp. Do not print captions, alt or native headlines."
    }
  },
